<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Digital Equipment started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Digital Equipment started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson Stephens said Friday that analyst Bret Rekas started coverage of Digital Equipment Corp with a market performer rating.</p>
<p>-- Fiscal 1998 earnings estimate is $2.00 per share, rising to $2.40 in 1999.</p>
<p>-- &quot;With the exception of services, DEC can no longer claim a leadership position in any major segment of the computer systems market,&quot; Rekas said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 46-1/8.</p>
</text>
